# Docker Compose (no sudo)

**Do not prefix `docker` or `docker compose` with `sudo`** in this repo unless the user explicitly asks or the environment truly requires it (permission denied after a normal attempt).

Use:

```bash
docker compose up -d
docker compose exec web pnpm <command>
docker compose exec api php artisan <command>
docker compose run --rm e2e pnpm test:e2e
```

Agents and docs must show commands **without** `sudo`. If a command fails with permission errors, report that to the user instead of silently switching to `sudo`.

